Subject: [PATCH] Integrate grasping_pipeline execution and confirm real PODGE
 interface

- Wire spatialkg_to_graspkg_handoff.py to grasping_pipeline's real
  /robot_llm actionlib action (confirmed from source) for actual
  pick/place/handover execution instead of a stub.
- Replace the guessed single-service PODGE interface
  (object_detector_msgs/get_poses) with the confirmed two-stage
  actionlib interface (robokudo_msgs/GenericImgProcAnnotatorAction:
  object detector then pose estimator), read directly from
  grasping_pipeline's own object_detector.py/pose_estimator.py source.
- Mark haf_grasping_client.py as superseded for the main path, since
  grasping_pipeline already wraps haf_grasping internally.
- Update launch files, package.xml deps, and docs (README.md,
  TESTING.md, both ros/*/README.md) to match.
